OL,3,GNEWSALives of Potteries women          
OL,4,Acelebrated in new book                 
OL,6,FIrene Mountford's father was killed in 
OL,7,Fa mining disaster in Sneyd Green,      
OL,8,FStoke-on-Trent, on 1 January, 1942.    
OL,10,FNow aged 86, she remembers how her     
OL,11,Fmother was left to bring up            
OL,12,F18-month-old twins and a nine-year-old 
OL,13,Fchild. She also remembers picking coal 
OL,14,Fas as a child and how she went on to   
OL,15,Fbecome one of the first girls in the   
OL,16,Fcountry to gain a Duke of Edinburgh's  
OL,17,FAward.                                 
